  "spelling_notes": {
    "চূন": "the image looked like চূন, but the standard spelling is চুন - a ু, not a ূ. So it is not a ূ-কার word at all; ভূগোল took its place in that list",
    "গগণ": "the primer writes গগণ; the standard spelling is গগন, so it is left out of the table",
    "কলসী": "the primer writes কলসী; the game uses কলসি, which is the modern standard",
    "পদবী": "the primer writes পদবী; modern standard is পদবি",
    "নানী": "the primer writes নানী; modern standard is নানি, which the game uses",
