    "করবী": "a name, so left out",
    "দৈন": "not a word on its own; দৈন্য is. Left out",
    "জ্যৈষ্ঠ": "correct, but a four-part conjunct - kept out of the ঐ-কার list as too hard to read there",
    "দূর্বা": "the primer writes দূর্বা; standard is দুর্বা. Left out",
    "ভূসি": "the primer writes ভূসি; standard is ভুসি. Left out",
    "হূল": "the primer writes হূল; standard is হুল. Left out",
    "ছন": "the primer's ছ + ন = ছন; the standard spelling of the thatch word is ছন, kept",
    "জম": "the primer's জ + ম = জম is not a standard word on its own. Left out",
    "রত্নাকার": "in the ন-ফলা list, but absent from 120,000 attested words - too literary for a child's page",
    "সন্নিধান": "in the ন-ফলা list, but absent from 120,000 attested words - too literary for a child's page",
    "ভস্ম": "printed in the ষ্ম row, but ভস্ম carries স্ম. Moved to স্ম",
    "পক্ক": "the ক্ক row prints পক্ব, which is ক্ব. পক্ব is the standard spelling, so it sits in the ক্ব row and the ক্ক row got মক্কা, ধাক্কা, ছক্কা instead",
